msgstr "soektog verskaffer naam:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:46
msgid "Enter the human readable name of the search provider here."
msgstr "invoer die menslik leesbaar naam van die soektog verskaffer hier."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:50
msgid "Search &URI:"
msgstr "soektog uri:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Enter the URI that is used to do a search on the search engine here.\n"
"The whole text to be searched for can be specified as \\{@} or \\{0}.\n"
"Recommended is \\{@}, since it removes all query variables (name=value) from "
"the resulting string whereas \\{0} will be substituted with the unmodified "
"query string.\n"
"You can use \\{1} ... \\{n} to specify certain words from the query and "
"\\{name} to specify a value given by 'name=value' in the user query.\n"
"In addition it is possible to specify multiple references (names, numbers "
"and strings) at once (\\{name1,name2,...,\"string\"}).\n"
"The first matching value (from the left) will be used as substitution value "
"for the resulting URI.\n"
"A quoted string can be used as default value if nothing matches from the "
"left of the reference list."
msgstr ""

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:65
msgid "UR&I Shortcuts:"
msgstr "uri kortpaaie:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:69
msgid ""
"The shortcuts entered here can be used as a pseudo-URI scheme in KDE. For "
"example, the shortcut <em>av</em> can be used as in <em>av</em>:<em>my "
"search</em>."
msgstr ""
"die kortpaaie ingevoerde hier kan wees gebruik word as 'n pseudo-URI skema "
"in kde. vir voorbeeld, die kortpad <em>av</em> kan wees gebruik word as in "
"<em>av</em>:<em>my soektog</em>."

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:73
msgid "&Charset:"
msgstr "karakterstel:"

#: plugins/ikws/searchproviderdlg.cpp:77
msgid "Select the character set that will be used to encode your search query."
msgstr ""
"kies die karakter stel wat sal wees gebruik word aan enkodeer jou soektog "
"navraag."

